  "notes": "{偽造|ぎぞう} refers to creating a fake version of something from scratch with intent to deceive. A legal and criminal term.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {偽造|ぎぞう}⟦{紙幣|しへい}→紙幣：00363_shihei⟧: counterfeit banknotes\n- {偽造|ぎぞう}⟦パスポート→パスポート：00341_pasupooto⟧: forged passport\n- ⟦{文書|ぶんしょ}→文書：12947_bunsho⟧{偽造|ぎぞう}: document forgery\n- {偽造|ぎぞう}⟦{品|ひん}→品：03712_hin⟧: counterfeit goods\n- {偽造|ぎぞう}⟦{防止|ぼうし}→防止：14571_boushi⟧: anti-counterfeiting\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{改竄|かいざん}→改竄：07943_kaizan⟧: tampering, falsification (altering an existing document)\n- ⟦{偽物|にせもの}→偽物：11521_nisemono⟧: fake, counterfeit (the resulting item)\n- ⟦{模造|もぞう}→模造：18492_mozou⟧: imitation (not always illegal — e.g., ⟦{模造|もぞう}→模造：18492_mozou⟧⟦{品|ひん}→品：03712_hin⟧ can be a legal replica)\n- ⟦{捏造|ねつぞう}→捏造：07628_netsuzou⟧: fabrication (especially of facts or data)",
